# .cbmignore — codebase-memory-mcp index excludes (gitignore syntax)
# Keeps the knowledge graph to first-party source. The Flutter platform dirs
# vendor plugin sources under */flutter/ephemeral/.plugin_symlinks, which pollute
# name-based call resolution (e.g. Flutter `Column` mis-linking to a React `card.tsx`).

# Flutter native platform dirs (contain */flutter/ephemeral/.plugin_symlinks)
**/android/
**/ios/
**/macos/
**/windows/
**/linux/
**/ephemeral/
**/.plugin_symlinks/
**/local_plugins/

# Generated / build output (mostly covered by .gitignore already)
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/lib/api/generated/
